{"meta":{"ph":"ˈsɒrəʊ; NAmE ˈsɑːroʊ","pos":"noun","stars":"★★"},"defs":[{"def":"a feeling of great sadness because sth very bad has happened 悲伤；悲痛；悲哀","ex":[{"s":"Dance expresses love and hate, joy and sorrow, life and death, and everything else in between.","src":"2018全国III卷·七选五","cat":"gaokao","year":2018,"t":"舞蹈表达爱与恨、喜与悲、生与死，以及其间的一切。"}]},{"def":"a very sad event or situation 伤心事；悲伤事；不幸","ex":[{"s":"She was sensible and clever; but eager in everything: her sorrows, her joys, could have no moderation.","src":"外研社B5 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"她既明智又聪明;但热衷于一切:她的悲哀、喜悦,是无法温和的。"},{"s":"They gave themselves up wholly to their sorrow, seeking increase of wretchedness in every reflection that could afford it, and resolved against ever admitting consolation in future.","src":"外研社B5 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"他们完全沉浸在自己的悲伤中，在每一个能带来这种凄惨的回忆里寻求更深的痛苦，并决心今后不再接受任何安慰。"},{"s":"It is an outburst of wild defiant sorrow, and of contempt for all the adversities of the world.","src":"外研社B5 U6","cat":"waiyan","t":"这是一种野生的悖逆的悲哀,是对世界所有不利因素的蔑视。"},{"s":"Yang’s death was a huge blow to his loyal troops, but they turned sorrow into anger and continued to fight fiercely against the invaders.","src":"外研社B6 U3","cat":"waiyan","t":"杨的死对他忠诚的部队是沉重打击，但他们把悲伤化为愤怒，继续与入侵者激烈战斗。"},{"s":"We’ve been told since we were toddlers that \"It’s good to share\" Parents and teachers keep reminding us to share toys, snacks, books, happy memories, and sometimes even sorrows with others.","src":"外研社B7 U4","cat":"waiyan","t":"父母和老师不断提醒我们分享玩具、小吃、书本、快乐的记忆, 有时甚至会与他人分享悲伤。"}]}]}